      "consequence": {
        "kind": "behavior-change",
        "exposedClass": "review-required",
        "statement": "For L7 policies that use terminatingTLS, the `ca.crt` in the secret is no longer loaded, so Envoy no longer requires client certificates from pods during TLS termination. To keep the old behaviour, set `--use-full-tls-context=true`.",
        "remediation": "If you depend on the old behaviour, where client certificates were required because `ca.crt` was loaded, set `--use-full-tls-context=true`.",
        "severity": "medium"
      },
      "statement": "In Cilium 1.16.0, L7 network policies that use terminatingTLS no longer load the `ca.crt` key from the secret, even when the secret contains it, so Envoy stops requiring client certificates from pods; setting `--use-full-tls-context=true` keeps the old behaviour."
    },
